        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                "word": "disparité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b6e8f724-9e27-4bb1-ad6f-19dbad531e96",
                        "entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "disparités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "339137dd-353d-3899-ad80-a45d4f900df8",
                        "entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Manque de parité, absence d'égalité entre des personnes ou des choses que l'on compare."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "17957069-670e-42b9-85d4-0be6ddc0c508",
                                "sense_id": "339137dd-353d-3899-ad80-a45d4f900df8",
                                "text": "Les données obtenues, illustrées dans les deux cartes ci-dessous, mettent en évidence des disparités géographiques surprenantes : dans certaines régions, la puberté précoce est douze fois plus fréquente que dans d'autres (six fois plus chez les garçons)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "878feb15-f778-4c9b-8e08-3c3e5d97878b",
                        "source_entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                        "source_sense_id": "339137dd-353d-3899-ad80-a45d4f900df8",
                        "target_lang_word": "Disparität",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Disparität",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28c6b978-e2fd-3cf1-ae27-6f6b1729f645",
                                        "entry_id": "be62707b-cc4b-3315-b6ed-ed40a11e5ad6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gleichzeitigkeit, Nebeneinander von Ungleichheiten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e849842-36ad-474d-a9c2-a19b803b2a21",
                                                "sense_id": "28c6b978-e2fd-3cf1-ae27-6f6b1729f645",
                                                "text": "Die Disparitäten in den Strukturen meines Unternehmens treiben uns noch in den Ruin!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b73dec08-c0f9-48ca-82ae-853d1fc845f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                        "source_sense_id": "339137dd-353d-3899-ad80-a45d4f900df8",
                        "target_lang_word": "disparity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "disparity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d546d42-ac03-39df-b0b2-0ea3c81175af",
                                        "entry_id": "0e4a25f5-d018-339f-82aa-0d8ca685fd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being unequal; difference."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52533fbf-ceb9-44cd-8701-f72dc1d37e7c",
                                                "sense_id": "0d546d42-ac03-39df-b0b2-0ea3c81175af",
                                                "text": "With no great disparity between them in point of years, they were, in every other respect, as unlike and far removed from each other as two men could well be. The one was soft-spoken, delicately made, precise, and elegant; the other, a burly square-built man, negligently dressed, rough and abrupt in manner, stern, and, in his present mood, forbidding both in look and speech."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26664d2a-3bc4-43f6-924d-dd4740e25c66",
                                                "sense_id": "0d546d42-ac03-39df-b0b2-0ea3c81175af",
                                                "text": "There was a disparity of view over the use of diesel or electric motive power for the route south of Crewe, and the Prime Minister even felt a modern design of steam locomotives would be the best solution."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7166d0c-30a7-31c9-aed8-da2b971db42d",
                                        "entry_id": "0e4a25f5-d018-339f-82aa-0d8ca685fd62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incongruity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9dc9491-d641-40b5-aa53-65f595b85c45",
                        "source_entry_id": "922db97a-792b-3fca-bbbd-a2091fed2d6d",
                        "source_sense_id": "339137dd-353d-3899-ad80-a45d4f900df8",
                        "target_lang_word": "ongelijkheid",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ongelijkheid",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf19595b-b640-3465-b725-d3fd3bd27153",
                                        "entry_id": "83b5da25-ba35-39b6-8f18-da418f9a2d6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het door de staat voortrekken van de een en achterstellen van de ander"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89b4c1c8-7c06-4f55-93ea-2cf49d231884",
                                                "sense_id": "bf19595b-b640-3465-b725-d3fd3bd27153",
                                                "text": "Soms is ongelijkheid een kwestie van ras, soms van geslacht dan weer van taal, geloof of seksuele oriëntatie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00721b6b-138f-4905-9020-7a733da0151b",
                                                "sense_id": "bf19595b-b640-3465-b725-d3fd3bd27153",
                                                "text": "In het boek 'The spirit level, Why Greater Equality Makes Societies Stronger' van Richard Wilkinson wordt aangetoond hoe een hogere mate van ongelijkheid in een maatschappij samenhangt met allerlei sociaal destabiliserende elementen, zoals meer tienerzwangerschappen, slechtere gezondheid en meer geweld"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "044f7764-58f1-3ecb-9570-283e2c3e07c7",
                                        "entry_id": "83b5da25-ba35-39b6-8f18-da418f9a2d6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een uitdrukking die weergeeft dat een grootheid niet gelijk is aan een ander, maar bijvoorbeeld groter"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
